+## 4. Retrieve Daily Link Analytics
+
+Retrieves daily click analytics for an active short link over a contiguous UTC date window ending on the current UTC date. Inactive dates within the window are zero-filled.
+
+- **Path**: `/analytics/{code}/daily`
+- **Method**: `GET`
+
+### Path Parameters
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `code` | string | Yes | The generated short code or custom alias. |
+
+### Query Parameters
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Allowed Values | Description |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `days` | integer | No | `7` | `1` to `90` | Number of consecutive UTC days to include in the analytics window, ending on the current UTC date. |
+
+### Responses
+
+#### `200 OK`
+Returned when the short link exists and is active. The response contains the link code, lifetime aggregate clicks (`totalClicks`), the evaluated `days` count, and a chronologically ascending array (`daily`) containing consecutive UTC date records.
+
+*Date Window Semantics:* An N-day window covers `[Today UTC - (N - 1) days]` through `[Today UTC]`.
+
+```json
+{
+  "code": "promo-2026",
+  "totalClicks": 12,
+  "days": 7,
+  "daily": [
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-24",
+      "clicks": 0
+    },
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-25",
+      "clicks": 1
+    },
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-26",
+      "clicks": 0
+    },
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-27",
+      "clicks": 4
+    },
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-28",
+      "clicks": 2
+    },
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-29",
+      "clicks": 5
+    },
+    {
+      "date": "2026-03-30",
+      "clicks": 0
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+*Note on Historical Data:* Daily click tracking starts upon deployment; clicks occurring prior to feature release are not retroactively backfilled into daily distributions and will appear as 0, though lifetime `totalClicks` reflects all visits.
+
+#### `400 Bad Request`
+Returned if the `days` parameter is non-numeric, less than `1`, greater than `90`, or contains malformed values.
+
+```json
+{
+  "error": "The days parameter must be an integer between 1 and 90."
+}
+```
+
+#### `404 Not Found`
+Returned matching `GET /analytics/{code}` behavior when:
+- The code does not exist.
+- The short link has expired.
+
+```json
+{
+  "error": "Short link not found or expired."
+}
+```
+
+#### `500 Internal Server Error`
+Returned in unexpected error scenarios without leaking internal stack traces or database error details.
+
+```json
+{
+  "error": "An unexpected error occurred."
+}
+```
+
